=Evaluate this leave request and decide if it should be auto-approved, needs manager review, or should be flagged.

Request:
- Employee: {{ $('Calculate Leave Days').item.json.employee }}
- Type: {{ $('Calculate Leave Days').item.json.type }}
- Days: {{ $('Calculate Leave Days').item.json.days }}
- Dates: {{ $('Calculate Leave Days').item.json.start_date }} to {{ $('Calculate Leave Days').item.json.end_date }}
- Reason: {{ $('Calculate Leave Days').item.json.reason }}

Leave Balance Record: {{ JSON.stringify($input.item.json) }}

Rules:
- Sick leave under 3 days: auto-approve
- Annual leave under 5 days with sufficient balance: auto-approve
- More than 5 days or low balance: needs manager review
- Emergency leave: auto-approve always

Return JSON: {"decision": "auto_approve/needs_review/flagged", "reason": "", "days_remaining_after": 0}

